            "detailed_description": "Escape the Mazes is a puzzle game where the player need to find the exit of differents mazes! Do you think you can find your way to escape the mazes? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures: <br />\r\n- 25 handcrafted mazes. <br />\r\n- 1 bonus level : “The Impossible Maze”. <br />\r\n- More then 10 hours of gameplay. <br />\r\n- Great soundtrack with over 25 songs.<br />\r\n- Steam cards and achievements. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout the bonus level: <br />\r\nIf you beat the 25 mazes, you will unlock “The Impossible Maze”. Try to beat this hardcore maze to earn a really rare Steam achievement and to enter the hall of fame of the game.",
